{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","灿烂花语"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Floral Splendor"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一个目标标记“花语”，之后对场上所有被“花语”标记的目标造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Parisa marks a target with a flower and deals AoE damage to them."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名未被“花语”标记的敌人标记“花语”直至战斗结束，之后对所有被“花语”标记目标以及周围1格的敌人造成480% ATK伤害。被攻击的目标在2秒内受到多次该技能伤害时，后续伤害均降低20%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Parisa marks a non-marked enemy with a flower until the battle ends, dealing 480% ATK damage to all floral-marked targets and other enemies within 1 tiles of them. If the skill hits the targets multiple times within 2s, the subsequent damage dealt by targets is reduced by 20%."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":77,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至490% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 490% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每个被标记“花语”的敌人被击败时，帕瑞莎在接下来的5秒内每秒回复60 + 20点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Each defeated enemy who carries Floral Mark grants Parisa 60 + 20 Energy recovery per second in 5s."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":60,"end":65,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 510% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 520% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","繁花祈佑"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Floral Inspiration"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己与一名友军提升攻击速度与普通攻击伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Parisa increases ATK SPD and normal attack damage for herself and an ally."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为自己与最近的1名友军提升22 + 3点攻击速度，并使自己和该名友军的普通攻击伤害提高22%，持续10秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Parisa increases ATK SPD by 22 + 3 and normal attack damage by 22% for 10s for herself and 1 nearest ally."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","提升的攻击速度提高至25 + 3，普通攻击伤害提升比例提高至25%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 25 + 3, and the normal attack damage by 25%."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","提升的攻击速度提高至28 + 3，普通攻击伤害提升比例提高至28%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 28 + 3, and the normal attack damage by 28%."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","提升的攻击速度提高至30 + 3，普通攻击伤害提升比例提高至30%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 30 + 3, and the normal attack damage by 30%."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","花意漫漫"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Flower Power"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","每当自己进行若干次普通攻击伤害，下一次普通攻击将改为发射花丛对沿途所有敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Parisa shoots flowers to attack enemies along the path after a number of normal attacks."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当帕瑞莎累计进行3次普通攻击，自身的下一次普通攻击将改为向目标所在的方向发射一团持续蔓延的花丛，对沿途的所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害。花丛每击中一名敌人，将使自己额外回复70能量，同一个花丛最多产生3次额外回能效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","After every 3 normal attacks, Parisa launches a bouquet of flowers that gradually expands toward her target, dealing 200% + 20% ATK damage to all enemies along the path. Each enemy hit by flowers restores herself an extra 70 Energy. Every bouquet of flowers can recover her Energy up to 3 times."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":121,"end":127,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":117,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","花丛伤害提升至205% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","The flowers deal 205% + 20% ATK damage."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","花丛伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","The flowers deal 210% + 20% ATK damage."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","花丛伤害提升至215% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","The flowers deal 215% + 20% ATK damage."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","盛开时刻"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Falling Blossom"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，给最接近对称位置的敌人标记“花语”。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Parisa marks the nearest enemy in a symmetrical position with a flower when a battle starts."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，给最接近对称位置的敌人标记“花语”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Parisa marks the nearest enemy in a symmetrical position with a flower when a battle starts."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","累计标记4次“花语”后，普通攻击会额外攻击1个目标。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Normal attacks hit 1 more target after inflicting 4 marks. "],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","累计标记3次“花语”后，普通攻击会额外攻击1个目标。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Normal attacks hit 1 more target after inflicting 3 marks. "],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","累计标记2次“花语”后，普通攻击会额外攻击1个目标。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Normal attacks hit 1 more target after inflicting 2 marks. "],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放技能“花意漫漫”所需的普通攻击次数降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Parisa triggers Flower Power with fewer normal attacks."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放技能“花意漫漫”所需的普通攻击次数降低-1次。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Reduces the required normal attacks to trigger Flower Power by -1."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“繁花祈佑”不再有初始冷却时间。首次释放本技能后，“繁花祈佑”会额外选择1名友军作为目标。额外目标优先选择造成普攻伤害最高的友军。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Floral Inspiration no longer has an initial cooldown. After this skill is cast for the first time, Floral Inspiration targets 1 extra allies, prioritizing those who have dealt the most normal attack damage."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","飞花手杖"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Flowers' Embrace"]]}